Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Dynamic Data Lists|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Structures
	And WebContentStructures add CP
		|structureDescription|WC Structure Description|
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Image|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Image|
		|fieldName|image|
	And WebContentStructures save CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Manage Templates
	And WebContentTemplates add CP
		|templateDescription|WC Template Description|
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
		|templateName|WC Template Name|
	And WebContentTemplates add Structure
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
		|templateFieldNames|Image|
		|templateLanguage|ftl|
	And WebContentTemplates save
	Then ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Field Translations
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|DDMStructureWithImageField#ViewFieldTranslations|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add With Structure CP
		|structureName|WC Structure Name|
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentTitle|English (United States) Title|
	And ItemSelector goto Item Selector Via Select Button
	And ItemSelector upload File
		|navTab|Documents and Media|
		|uploadFileName|Document_3.png|
	And FormFields edit Text Alt
		|fieldName|image|
		|fieldValue|English (United States) Image Description|
	And WebContent add Locale
		|language|Spanish (Spain)|
		|locale|es-ES|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|title|
		|fieldValue|Spanish (Spain) Title|
	And FormFields edit Text Alt
		|fieldName|image|
		|fieldValue|Spanish (Spain) Image Description|
	And WebContent add Locale
		|language|Portuguese (Brazil)|
		|locale|pt-BR|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|title|
		|fieldValue|Portuguese (Brazil) Title|
	And FormFields edit Text Alt
		|fieldName|image|
		|fieldValue|Portuguese (Brazil) Image Description|
	And WebContent select Locale
		|locale|en-US|
	And FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|title|
		|fieldValue|English (United States) Title|
	And FormFields view Text Value Alt
		|fieldName|image|
		|fieldValue|English (United States) Image Description|
	And WebContent select Locale
		|locale|es-ES|
	And FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|title|
		|fieldValue|Spanish (Spain) Title|
	And FormFields view Text Value Alt
		|fieldName|image|
		|fieldValue|Spanish (Spain) Image Description|
	And WebContent select Locale
		|locale|pt-BR|
	And FormFields view Text Value
		|fieldName|title|
		|fieldValue|Portuguese (Brazil) Title|
	Then FormFields view Text Value Alt
		|fieldName|image|
		|fieldValue|Portuguese (Brazil) Image Description|